{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/they-came-from/beneath-the-sea/1468448-beneath-the-sea-jumpstart-and-complications","id":1468448,"title":"Beneath the Sea Jumpstart and Complications","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","They Came From...","...Beneath the Sea!"],"posts":[{"date":"2021-11-20T18:40:52-08:00","id":1468448,"title":"Beneath the Sea Jumpstart and Complications","content":"Hey all, trying to understand exactly how complications work in this system. In the Jumpstart the High as a Kite Condition adds complications to actions but doesn\u2019t say what happens if you don\u2019t buy off the Complication. Same for interrogating the weed dealer who is high and has complications. What happens if you succeed with the complication?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/565-therian","name":"Therian","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar565_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"311"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-21T01:00:10-08:00","id":1468465,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Therian</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/they-came-from/beneath-the-sea/1468448-beneath-the-sea-jumpstart-and-complications#post1468448\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hey all, trying to understand exactly how complications work in this system. In the Jumpstart the High as a Kite Condition adds complications to actions but doesn\u2019t say what happens if you don\u2019t buy off the Complication. Same for interrogating the weed dealer who is high and has complications. What happens if you succeed with the complication?</div> </div> </div> </div>Citing Scion Discord admin ( Kyman ) on Complications matter in Storypath:<br /> <br /> <i>I acknowledge that at times some parts use &quot;Complication&quot; as flat difficulty increases ( which are Difficulty manipulations ). Which I acknowledge is not how base Complications are supposed to be used. Which is frustrating. ( But it happens on writers side )</i><br /> <br /> Basicllly, <b>Storypath engine clearly states that Difficulty MUST by buy to succeed in action - Complications NOT NEED to be bought.</b> ( But then BAD THINGS HAPPEN. ) However, many writers on Storypath products use Complications as extra Difficulty modifiers, meaning rising Difficulty in task - but STILL using Complications in text. It IS frustrating, across any SP gameline, I must admit.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-22T21:19:22-08:00","id":1468655,"title":"","content":"Ok, so that's a bit confusing. I really like the idea of players having to make the choice. Seems weird that it just adds difficulty..","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/565-therian","name":"Therian","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar565_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"311"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-22T21:43:01-08:00","id":1468658,"title":"","content":"Any suggestions on how to approach this? I know when I'm doing my own thing I can come up with Complications but still learning the system.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/565-therian","name":"Therian","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar565_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"311"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-23T04:30:32-08:00","id":1468673,"title":"","content":"Complications aren't Difficulty. You can succeed at a task without buying off the Complications, but each level of Complication not bought off adds.. well.. a complication. For instance, if I'm climbing over a chainlink fence to escape a pursuing werelobster, it may be a Difficulty 1 task with 2 Complications. I roll one success but don't buy off the Complications, meaning I climb the fence, but I suffer a scratch (1 damage) and my wallet falls from my pocket into the lobster's claw. That's two Complications.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:#000080\">Matthew Dawkins</span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000080\">In-House Developer for Onyx Path Publishing</span></b><br /> <br /> <i><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><b><span style=\"color:#008080\">Website: </span><a href=\"http://www.matthewdawkins.com\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008080\">https://www.matthewdawkins.com</span></a><br /> <span style=\"color:#008080\">Patreon: </span><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/matthewdawkins\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008080\">https://www.patreon.com/matthewdawkins</span></a></b></span></i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/152-the-gentleman-gamer","name":"The Gentleman Gamer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar152_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1698"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-23T04:32:36-08:00","id":1468674,"title":"","content":"To add further: it doesn't always say what a Complication should be because it can differ from scene to scene. In terms of the High as a Kite Condition, Complications might include offending someone (reducing their Attitude of you), tripping over your own feet (suffer a damage), leaving a trail of cannabis odour in your wake, being more likely to get arrested, etc. They're narrative tools, primarily.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:#000080\">Matthew Dawkins</span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000080\">In-House Developer for Onyx Path Publishing</span></b><br /> <br /> <i><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><b><span style=\"color:#008080\">Website: </span><a href=\"http://www.matthewdawkins.com\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008080\">https://www.matthewdawkins.com</span></a><br /> <span style=\"color:#008080\">Patreon: </span><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/matthewdawkins\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008080\">https://www.patreon.com/matthewdawkins</span></a></b></span></i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/152-the-gentleman-gamer","name":"The Gentleman Gamer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar152_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1698"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-23T05:06:18-08:00","id":1468676,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Therian</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/they-came-from/beneath-the-sea/1468448-beneath-the-sea-jumpstart-and-complications?p=1468658#post1468658\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Any suggestions on how to approach this? I know when I'm doing my own thing I can come up with Complications but still learning the system.</div> </div> </div> </div>Come up with BAD STUFF Condition that will be in effect, if players will not you Complications - simple. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-24T06:06:07-08:00","id":1468750,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/they-came-from/beneath-the-sea/1468448-beneath-the-sea-jumpstart-and-complications?p=1468465#post1468465\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Citing Scion Discord admin ( Kyman ) on Complications matter in Storypath:</div> </div> </div> </div>As a note, the Scion Discord is not an official Onyx Path Discord. Rules questions like this are better asked on our official Discord, where many of the writers and developers of the Storypath games would he happy to answer questions! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#555555\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">https://discord.gg/5uckcBk</span></span></span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/15-eddyfate","name":"eddyfate","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar15_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"155"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}